  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6626c84bb700413428bce8fec5aff79d, type: 3}
  m_Name: HerOtherRelationships
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _description: 'player asks how jessi''s current relationships are going


    jessi
    admits that they''re not really going all that well, nor does she have many


    she
    probably has like. a friend or two. and one of them is mutual with the player
    (he who shall not be named)


    she doesnt really get invited out by her friends
    a lot


    overall unfulfilling relationships. or at least she''s not allowing
    them to be.


    player points out that her friends obviously Hate Her probably
    or at the very least aren''t fond of her. jessi wants to deny this, but she knows
    it''s true.


    well, no wonder, player says. a person like jessi doesn''t
    really deserve relationships like that anyways, if someone like her can even
    KEEP those relationships. her life is just misery because she''s trying to match
    up to these people and be friends with them when clearly she''s not deserving
    of that title.'
